(261, '<p>Today we start learning of&nbsp; php&nbsp; again. I learned about loops and some basic concept.</p>\r\n<p>after that we worked on the homevellay&nbsp; website. Resolve the issue of request information form of listing&nbsp; page and we create a short code for searching filter but it is not complete .json error is show .</p>\r\n<p>when i try on the live then creat a crital error. then i get cpenal access of hostinger.de then resolved the issu.</p>', '<p>creat short code</p>', 31, 18, '2023-07-04 18:45:11', '2023-07-04 18:45:11'),
(262, '<p>Task perform:</p>\r\n<p>Today I perform some task of homeysvalley.de website.</p>\r\n<p>1-Remove the Emergency contact from request page.</p>\r\n<p>2-Add request page form is&nbsp; not working on mobile.In which inputs are not enter in fields.I perform this Task&nbsp; uesing Css and correct some classes of form&nbsp; group.</p>\r\n<p>3- I learn about search filter with arif and Arif understand me some tricks to find the error related file.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Learning Perform:</p>\r\n<p>Today I learn in php&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>1-Variables</p>\r\n<p>perform some examples of variables and gettype variables.</p>\r\n<p>for example:</p>\r\n<p>&lt;?php</p>\r\n<p>$test_var;</p>\r\n<p>echo \"The data type of test_var is now:\" .gettype($test_var);</p>\r\n<p>echo\"&lt;/br&gt;\";</p>\r\n<p>$test_var = 15;</p>\r\n<p>echo\"The data type of test_var is now:\" .gettype($test_var);</p>\r\n<p>$test_var = 15.10;</p>\r\n<p>echo\"The data type of test_var is now:\" .gettype($test_var);</p>\r\n<p>echo\"&lt;/br&gt;\";</p>\r\n<p>$test_var = true;</p>\r\n<p>echo\"The data type of test_var is now:\" .gettype($test_var);</p>\r\n<p>echo\"&lt;/br&gt;\";</p>\r\n<p>$test_var = \"webpenter\";</p>\r\n<p>echo\"The data type of test_var is now:\" .gettype($test_var);</p>\r\n<p>echo\"&lt;/br&gt;\";</p>\r\n<p>?&gt;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Output:</p>\r\n<p>Warning: Undefined variable $test_var in C:\\xampp\\htdocs\\learn\\loop.php on line 15</p>\r\n<p>The data type of test_var is now: NULL</p>\r\n<p>The data type of test_var is now: integer</p>\r\n<p>The data type of test_var is now: double</p>\r\n<p>The data type of test_var is now: boolean</p>\r\n<p>The data type of test_var is now: string</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Data Types:</p>\r\n<p>1-Integer =5</p>\r\n<p>2-Double(flout) = 5.23</p>\r\n<p>3-String =\"webpenter\"</p>\r\n<p>4-object = some of functions and veriables.</p>\r\n<p>5-Bolean = ture anad false</p>\r\n<p>6-Array = some of veriables =&gt;array(1,2,3,4.......)</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Operators</p>\r\n<p>1-Assignment Operator&nbsp; (=)</p>\r\n<p>2-Combined operators ( +=,&nbsp; _=, *=,&nbsp; %= )</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;3-Comperision operators (==, &gt;=,&nbsp; &lt;=, !=, ===&nbsp; )</p>\r\n<p>4-Logical operator ( AND,&nbsp; OR,&nbsp; NOT).</p>', '<p>PHP learning</p>', 31, 18, '2023-07-05 18:15:13', '2023-07-05 18:15:13'),
(263, '<p>Good Evening Devs</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>today we learn about php functions</li>\r\n</ul>', '<p>tommorow we give assignment</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', 4, 15, '2023-07-05 18:22:22', '2023-07-05 18:22:22'),
(264, '<p>Today issues like mobile responsive and direct message button for listing (solved) and client new requirements create shortcode for the search form (Created)</p>', '<p>Will start 4th milestone</p>', 31, 19, '2023-07-06 18:07:59', '2023-07-06 18:07:59'),
(265, '<p>Task perform</p>\r\n<p>Today I perform some task of Homeysvellay.de website from client feedback.</p>\r\n<p>1-change header title layout which overlap with logo and heading of home page.</p>\r\n<p>2-Direct message button on request page set on specific place on mobile responsive.</p>\r\n<p>3-Direct message button on listing page set on specific place on mobile responsive.</p>\r\n<p>4-Add a field in the form (youerself finance and their option with radio button).</p>\r\n<p>5- some changing in the footer for mobile responsiv.</p>\r\n<p>6-And remove some small isuu of website layout.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Learning perform</p>\r\n<p>1-increment =&gt;$a++</p>\r\n<p>2-decrement=&gt;$a--</p>\r\n<p>3-pre increment =&gt;++$a</p>\r\n<p>4-pre decrement =&gt;--$a</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Attending Php class&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Learning topics</p>\r\n<p>1-INTRO of php from w3school.com</p>\r\n<p>2-Variables</p>\r\n<p>3-data types</p>\r\n<p>4-And some other examples about php.</p>', '<p>learning</p>', 31, 18, '2023-07-06 18:15:54', '2023-07-06 18:15:54'),
(266, '<p>Task perform</p>\r\n<p>Today I perform some task of Homeysvellay.de website from client feedback.</p>\r\n<p>1-change header title layout which overlap with logo and heading of home page.</p>\r\n<p>2-Direct message button on request page set on specific place on mobile responsive.</p>\r\n<p>3-Direct message button on listing page set on specific place on mobile responsive.</p>\r\n<p>4-Add a field in the form (youerself finance and their option with radio button).</p>\r\n<p>5- some changing in the footer for mobile responsiv.</p>\r\n<p>6-And remove some small isuu of website layout.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Learning perform</p>\r\n<p>1-increment =&gt;$a++</p>\r\n<p>2-decrement=&gt;$a--</p>\r\n<p>3-pre increment =&gt;++$a</p>\r\n<p>4-pre decrement =&gt;--$a</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Attending Php class&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Learning topics</p>\r\n<p>1-INTRO of php from w3school.com</p>\r\n<p>2-Variables</p>\r\n<p>3-data types</p>\r\n<p>4-And some other examples about php.</p>', '<p>learning</p>', 31, 18, '2023-07-06 18:15:57', '2023-07-06 18:15:57'),
