(384, '<p><span style=\"color: #d1d2d3; font-family: Slack-Lato, Slack-Fractions, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; font-variant-ligatures: common-ligatures; background-color: #222529;\">today update is:</span><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit; color: #d1d2d3; font-family: Slack-Lato, Slack-Fractions, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; font-variant-ligatures: common-ligatures; background-color: #222529;\" /><span style=\"color: #d1d2d3; font-family: Slack-Lato, Slack-Fractions, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; font-variant-ligatures: common-ligatures; background-color: #222529;\">1). we are able to adjust host fee in each property</span><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit; color: #d1d2d3; font-family: Slack-Lato, Slack-Fractions, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; font-variant-ligatures: common-ligatures; background-color: #222529;\" /><span style=\"color: #d1d2d3; font-family: Slack-Lato, Slack-Fractions, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; font-variant-ligatures: common-ligatures; background-color: #222529;\">2). if the days less then 35 then pay full other wise down payment</span><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit; color: #d1d2d3; font-family: Slack-Lato, Slack-Fractions, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; font-variant-ligatures: common-ligatures; background-color: #222529;\" /><span style=\"color: #d1d2d3; font-family: Slack-Lato, Slack-Fractions, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; font-variant-ligatures: common-ligatures; background-color: #222529;\">3). down payment added on each property</span><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit; color: #d1d2d3; font-family: Slack-Lato, Slack-Fractions, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; font-variant-ligatures: common-ligatures; background-color: #222529;\" /><span style=\"color: #d1d2d3; font-family: Slack-Lato, Slack-Fractions, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; font-variant-ligatures: common-ligatures; background-color: #222529;\">4).we are able to add icon with feature and aminities..<br 