(406, '<ul>\r\n<li>Daily Updates\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Today i learn about seo in webdevelopment</li>\r\n<li>Today i learn how to create a form using stripe api</li>\r\n<li>Today i see diferent products and sites to check there traffic and content</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', '<p>Tommorow i will try to learn more</p>', 67, 38, '2024-02-19 18:46:12', '2024-02-19 18:46:12'),
(407, '<p>Project Watch Zone</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Today i create payment method in my website and it was working completely</li>\r\n</ul>', '<p>tommorow i create the api</p>', 67, 27, '2024-02-19 18:48:46', '2024-02-19 18:48:46'),
(408, '<p><span style=\"color: #1d1c1d; font-family: Slack-Lato, Slack-Fractions, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; font-variant-ligatures: common-ligatures; background-color: #f8f8f8;\">1). Changed the color of calendar.</span><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit; color: #1d1c1d; font-family: Slack-Lato, Slack-Fractions, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; font-variant-ligatures: common-ligatures; background-color: #f8f8f8;\" /><span style=\"color: #1d1c1d; font-family: Slack-Lato, Slack-Fractions, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; font-variant-ligatures: common-ligatures; background-color: #f8f8f8;\">2). Removed the double line from colander.</span><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit; color: #1d1c1d; font-family: Slack-Lato, Slack-Fractions, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; font-variant-ligatures: common-ligatures; background-color: #f8f8f8;\" /><span style=\"color: #1d1c1d; font-family: Slack-Lato, Slack-Fractions, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; font-variant-ligatures: common-ligatures; background-color: #f8f8f8;\">3). Removed the space from sticky filter.</span><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit; color: #1d1c1d; font-family: Slack-Lato, Slack-Fractions, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; font-variant-ligatures: common-ligatures; background-color: #f8f8f8;\" /><span style=\"color: #1d1c1d; font-family: Slack-Lato, Slack-Fractions, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; font-variant-ligatures: common-ligatures; background-color: #f8f8f8;\">4). Managed the height of filter on mobile.</span><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit; color: #1d1c1d; font-family: Slack-Lato, Slack-Fractions, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; font-variant-ligatures: common-ligatures; background-color: #f8f8f8;\" /><span style=\"color: #1d1c1d; font-family: Slack-Lato, Slack-Fractions, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; font-variant-ligatures: common-ligatures; background-color: #f8f8f8;\">5).A guest canceled their reservation. We need an email trigger to admin when a reservation is canceled or when messages have been sent or received. (Now these emails come on \"</span><a class=\"c-link\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; text-decoration-line: none; font-family: Slack-Lato, Slack-Fractions, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; font-variant-ligatures: common-ligatures; background-color: #f8f8f8;\" href=\"mailto:cabins@brokenbow.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-stringify-link=\"mailto:cabins@brokenbow.com\" data-sk=\"tooltip_parent\" aria-haspopup=\"menu\">cabins@brokenbow.com</a><span style=\"color: #1d1c1d; font-family: Slack-Lato, Slack-Fractions, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; font-variant-ligatures: common-ligatures; background-color: #f8f8f8;\">\").</span><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit; color: #1d1c1d; font-family: Slack-Lato, Slack-Fractions, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; font-variant-ligatures: common-ligatures; background-color: #f8f8f8;\" /><span style=\"color: #1d1c1d; font-family: Slack-Lato, Slack-Fractions, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; font-variant-ligatures: common-ligatures; background-color: #f8f8f8;\">6). Messaging deletion (there sender and receiver only be able to delete messages the admin and host not be able to delete it. )</span><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit; color: #1d1c1d; font-family: Slack-Lato, Slack-Fractions, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; font-variant-ligatures: common-ligatures; background-color: #f8f8f8;\" /><span style=\"color: #1d1c1d; font-family: Slack-Lato, Slack-Fractions, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; font-variant-ligatures: common-ligatures; background-color: #f8f8f8;\">7). Enabled the contact host form on detail page \"now restrict to user they are enter the valid phone number \"</span><a class=\"c-link\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; text-decoration-line: none; font-family: Slack-Lato, Slack-Fractions, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; font-variant-ligatures: common-ligatures; background-color: #f8f8f8;\" href=\"tel:+12345678900\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-stringify-link=\"tel:+12345678900\" data-sk=\"tooltip_parent\">+12345678900</a><span style=\"color: #1d1c1d; font-family: Slack-Lato, Slack-Fractions, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; font-variant-ligatures: common-ligatures; background-color: #f8f8f8;\">\" i think using this spam issue will be resolve.</span><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit; color: #1d1c1d; font-family: Slack-Lato, Slack-Fractions, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; font-variant-ligatures: common-ligatures; background-color: #f8f8f8;\" /><span style=\"color: #1d1c1d; font-family: Slack-Lato, Slack-Fractions, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; font-variant-ligatures: common-ligatures; background-color: #f8f8f8;\">8). This booking was confirmed, lady decided to cancel. We need to be able to adjust these, if booking is cancel the dates open back up (Now the date will be open up.).</span><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit; color: #1d1c1d; font-family: Slack-Lato, Slack-Fractions, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; font-variant-ligatures: common-ligatures; background-color: #f8f8f8;\" /><span style=\"color: #1d1c1d; font-family: Slack-Lato, Slack-Fractions, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; font-variant-ligatures: common-ligatures; background-color: #f8f8f8;\">9). Adjust the space of buttons on mobile.</span></p>', '<p>i will check the things about price lab</p>', 48, 13, '2024-02-20 09:11:12', '2024-02-20 09:11:12');
