(413, '<ul>\r\n<li>Daily Updates\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Today i try to create a project that sir is assigned to me&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>Today i learn about seo(search engine optimization)</li>\r\n<li>Today i learn Watch tutorials on the youtube</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', '<p>Tommorow i will try to learn more</p>', 67, 38, '2024-02-20 20:09:28', '2024-02-20 20:09:28'),
(414, '<p>Good Evening<br /><br />Today Update:<br /><br />&nbsp;</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Worked on multiple Budgeting</li>\r\n<li>worked on homey mobile documentation and its webpage&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>did testing of 2 client websites&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>gave classes to both girls and boys campus</li>\r\n</ul>', '<p>will follow the same flow&nbsp;</p>', 4, 3, '2024-02-20 20:13:51', '2024-02-20 20:13:51'),
(415, '<p style=\"border: 0px solid #e3e3e3; box-sizing: border-box; --tw-border-spacing-x: 0; --tw-border-spacing-y: 0; --tw-translate-x: 0; --tw-translate-y: 0; --tw-rotate: 0; --tw-skew-x: 0; --tw-skew-y: 0; --tw-scale-x: 1; --tw-scale-y: 1; --tw-scroll-snap-strictness: proximity; --tw-ring-offset-width: 0px; --tw-ring-offset-color: #fff; --tw-ring-color: rgb(59 130 246 / 0.5); --tw-ring-offset-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-ring-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-shadow-colored: 0 0 #0000; margin: 1.25em 0px; color: #0d0d0d; font-family: S&ouml;hne, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \'Noto Sans\', sans-serif, \'Helvetica Neue\', Arial, \'Apple Color Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Symbol\', \'Noto Color Emoji\'; font-size: 16px; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">My work list for today:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000;\">I created posts for all social media platforms and posted them.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000;\">I completed a project for Ayub Sir, including a thumbnail or description.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000;\">I dedicated time to establishing an internet connection for the office.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000;\">I collected MAC addresses from junior and senior developers and inputted them into a Google Sheet.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Conducted some R&amp;D on the admin panel features.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Ahmed Bilal | Business Developer</span></p>', '<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Tomorrow\'s Tasks:</span><br /><br /><br /></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>I will create a post and upload</li>\r\n<li>I will do more R&amp;D on the admin panel</li>\r\n<li>Tomorrow I will try to send proposals</li>\r\n<li>I will do R&amp;D to search for which additional work we can do</li>\r\n<li>And if sir Rashid or Ayub can assign more work, I will do it for them.</li>\r\n</ul>', 4, 66, '2024-02-20 20:18:09', '2024-02-20 20:18:09'),
(416, '<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Ayub Khokhar&nbsp;<br /></strong>Front-End Developer | Team Lead | webpenter.LLC</span><br /><br /><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>email</strong>: ayubkhokhar786@gmail.com</span><br /><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>skype: </strong>ayubkhokhar786@gmail.com</span><br /><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>website</strong>: www.webpenter.com</span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', '<p>will follow the same routine</p>', 4, 3, '2024-02-20 20:24:36', '2024-02-20 20:24:36'),
(417, '<p><span style=\"color: #1d1c1d; font-family: Slack-Lato, Slack-Fractions, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; font-variant-ligatures: common-ligatures; background-color: #f8f8f8;\"><strong>Good Evening</strong><br /><br /><strong>Today Update:<br /></strong></span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"color: #1d1c1d; font-family: Slack-Lato, Slack-Fractions, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; font-variant-ligatures: common-ligatures; background-color: #f8f8f8;\"><strong>Worked on multiple Budgeting</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"color: #1d1c1d; font-family: Slack-Lato, Slack-Fractions, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; font-variant-ligatures: common-ligatures; background-color: #f8f8f8;\"><strong>worked on homey mobile documentation and its webpage</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"color: #1d1c1d; font-family: Slack-Lato, Slack-Fractions, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; font-variant-ligatures: common-ligatures; background-color: #f8f8f8;\"><strong>did testing of 2 client websites</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"color: #1d1c1d; font-family: Slack-Lato, Slack-Fractions, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; font-variant-ligatures: common-ligatures; background-color: #f8f8f8;\"><strong>gave classes to both girls and boys campus</strong></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Ayub Khokhar&nbsp;<br /></strong>Front-End Developer | Team Lead | webpenter.LLC</span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', '<p>will follow the same routine</p>', 4, 3, '2024-02-20 20:26:42', '2024-02-20 20:26:42'),
