(459, '<h2>Today Work Report:</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"color: #0d0d0d; font-family: S&ouml;hne, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \'Noto Sans\', sans-serif, \'Helvetica Neue\', Arial, \'Apple Color Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Symbol\', \'Noto Color Emoji\'; font-size: 16px; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">I have done some R&amp;D on Themeforest.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"color: #0d0d0d; font-family: S&ouml;hne, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \'Noto Sans\', sans-serif, \'Helvetica Neue\', Arial, \'Apple Color Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Symbol\', \'Noto Color Emoji\'; font-size: 16px; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">I have watched the SEO (Search Engine Optimization) Course.<br /></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>Ahmed Bilal | Business Developer</p>', '<p>Will discuss tomorrow</p>', 4, 66, '2024-03-04 19:02:27', '2024-03-04 19:02:27'),
(460, '<ul>\r\n<li>Daily Updates\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Today i learn what is console.log(\"\") in js</li>\r\n<li>Today i learn what is alert(\"\") and promt(\"\")</li>\r\n<li>Today i learn if else in js</li>\r\n<li>Today i learn about operators in js</li>\r\n<li>Today i learn about loops in js&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>Today i learn about js syntax&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>Today i learn how to run code in the console&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>Today i watch tutorial on youtube for js and learn more things</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Khurshid Bilal | Junior Dev | khurshid@webpenter.com | 0301-2648886</p>', '<p>Tommorow i will try to learn more</p>', 67, 38, '2024-03-04 19:03:05', '2024-03-04 19:03:05');
