(462, '<p>Mehtab Altaf | Junior Dev | sainmehtab15@gmail.com | 03146634665</p>\r\n<p><strong>Project Watch Zone</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Today i create a subscription page</li>\r\n<li>today i also trying to make a seller page where the user try to sell a product and i m also work on this</li>\r\n<li>today i watch a javascript tutorial where i can gain some basic concept of javascript</li>\r\n</ul>', '<p>tommorow i make these working</p>', 67, 27, '2024-03-05 18:21:42', '2024-03-05 18:21:42'),
