(733, '<ul>\r\n<li>Lecture on React Native</li>\r\n<li><span class=\"p-view_header__channel_title\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; white-space: break-spaces; word-break: break-word;\">working on</span><strong><span class=\"p-view_header__channel_title\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; white-space: break-spaces; word-break: break-word;\"> triciakeightley-homey-fiverr </span></strong><span class=\"p-view_header__channel_title\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; white-space: break-spaces; word-break: break-word;\">3 tasks</span></li>\r\n<li>\r\n<h3>Details for Task 1</h3>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Display 4-Hour System for Black Label</strong>:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>Backend Pricing</strong>: When adding a listing, the price is entered as a full day amount.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Display on Listing Detail Page</strong>: The displayed price for the black label on the listing detail page should represent a 4-hour segment of the full day price.\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>Example</strong>: If the full day price is $1975, the price displayed as a 4-hour segment should be half of the full day price: <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\">19752=987.50\\frac{1975}{2} = 987.50</span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\"><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1975</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"mord\">987.50</span></span></span></span>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>1-Hour Gap Between Bookings</strong>:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>Booking Interval</strong>: There should be a mandatory 1-hour gap between consecutive bookings. This means if a booking ends at 2 PM, the next booking can only start at 3 PM or later.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>4% Discount for Each Additional Hour After 4 Hours</strong>:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>Discount Policy</strong>: After the initial 4-hour booking, every additional hour will be discounted by 4%.\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>Calculation</strong>: If a booking extends beyond 4 hours, each subsequent hour after the 4th hour will have a 4% discount applied to its hourly rate.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ahmad Raza | Full Stack Developer | ahmedraza4119@gmail.com | 0309-3461901</p>', '<p>Lecture on React Native</p>', 4, 2, '2024-06-29 02:02:48', '2024-06-29 02:02:48'),
(734, '<p>Today i read overview documentation of wordpresss.</p>\r\n<p>Toady i again instal the wordpress thesm and explore the post section .</p>\r\n<p>Now I am leaving early because I have to be called from an important work at home. I will start working properly from monday.</p>\r\n<p>Sajid Abbasi | Student | nawabsajidbbasi236@gmail.com | 03337452719</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', '<p>Tommarow i will continue of my work.</p>', 67, 26, '2024-06-29 13:46:21', '2024-06-29 13:46:21'),
