(35, 90, '2024-08-07', 'Dear Supervisor/Manager\'s,\r\n\r\nI am writing to request leave from [07-08-2024] to [12-08-2024] for a trip to Murre. I believe this time away will be beneficial for several reasons:\r\n\r\nPersonal Well-Being: A break from the daily routine will allow me to recharge and refresh. The serene environment and natural beauty of Murre will provide a much-needed mental and physical rejuvenation.\r\n\r\nStress Relief: Spending time in a peaceful setting away from the usual work-related pressures will help in reducing stress and enhancing overall productivity upon my return.\r\n\r\nQuality Time: This trip provides an opportunity to spend quality time with family/friends, which is crucial for maintaining a healthy work-life balance.\r\n\r\nCultural and Natural Exploration: The trip will offer a chance to explore the local culture and natural landscapes, which can contribute to personal growth and a broader perspective.\r\n\r\nI assure you that I will ensure all my current tasks and responsibilities are managed effectively before my leave and will be available for any urgent matters if needed.\r\n\r\nThank you for considering my request. I look forward to your approval.\r\n\r\nBest regards,\r\nTaimoor Ahmad', '2024-08-05 14:45:59', '2024-08-05 14:45:59', NULL, '2024-08-12'),
